{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 68203, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 49266, "uid": 22757, "type": 4, "title": "木wb临时攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1611829434, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1612102279, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 25, "status": 1, "summary": "应要求临时写的，仅限参考，如果有错误请评论区和群内指出，请根据自己的天子练度进行调整，新入坑的玩家不要过多使用资源打WB一、活动简介boss技能如下难点分析：主要难点是SS的5体毒奶和不断叠加防御力，", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611829765292_6490290.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 5, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 13527, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 68203, "content": "应要求临时写的，仅限参考，如果有错误请评论区和群内指出，请根据自己的天子练度进行调整，新入坑的玩家不要过多使用资源打WB<div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; pointer-events: none;\" class=\"cGcvT\"></grammarly-extension><p class=\"title-p\" spellcheck=\"false\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 182, 79); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">一、活动简介</span></span></span></p></div></span><br></div><div>boss技能如下</div><div><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611829765292_6490290.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611829765292_6490290.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">难点分析：主要难点是SS的5体毒奶和不断叠加防御力，目前暂时会出现后排随机被打的情况，请注意，boss的DS特性放在后面说</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 182, 79); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">二、对策天子</span></span></span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">对策为情人节勒达，也就是火属性刀里的第三个SS六连，技能以及点火数据请参考官方公告。</div><div class=\"div-img\">目前的状况是3把火刀都为点火SS六连：火伞，魔龙，情人节勒达</div><div class=\"div-img\">情人节勒达有个特性是SS带有防御型增益爆发，如果能吃到加速是可以一定程度上抑制boss叠防的情况</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 182, 79); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">三、组队推荐</span></span></span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1.必上天子（由于有毒奶，请务必不要上除了花奶以外的任何奶妈，选择详情可以参考K佬的帖子<span><span>http://dc.gamekee.com/67740.html</span></span>）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594190653004_74793800.png\" alt=\"自嘲的娜薇\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zLZaEcirOAAAAALboDm0729.png\" alt=\"菜鸟莫娜\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zKz6EOgtKAAAAAEvuG8w788.png\" alt=\"血腥的巴托里\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/A3/ChpCl13wk32ED32ZAAAAAODL0Bw035.png\" alt=\"盲信的卢茵\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/98/ChpCl13uDuGEKaWvAAAAAAnDQSI094.png\" alt=\"审美的万达斯\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1610783799198_34303094.png\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 90px;\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1599027467205_89055324.png\" alt=\"逃亡缇丝贝\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 90px;\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zL9SEa45XAAAAAMR6pbY614.png\" alt=\"悲恸的忒提斯\"><span><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B2/ChpCl13zSHSEMdeHAAAAAEGYPAc091.png\" alt=\"派对巨星梅芙\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/15/EF/ChpCl157FTOEJenXAAAAAJGuApc899.png\" alt=\"特立独行伽那莎\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/F5/ChpCl14J1GmEF8z8AAAAANAoPjg116.png\" alt=\"神乐狼人\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 88px;\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/A4/ChpCl13wo_6EA2viAAAAABdDuH4613.png\" alt=\"甜美的希特莉\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604472186205_59774316.png\" style=\"width: 84px; height: 90px;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">糖猫、光月月、鲜花最好是3红。其中鲜花没有3红就不是必上。</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1.1上述天子技能预约</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">糖猫：带火勒达 S T T T T ；无火勒达 S 。<br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">火人鱼：S T T T T 。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">派对梅芙、金币娘：0红，S ；6红，S T T T T 。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><span>光月月：如果只有SS刀，不论3红6红，S ；如果有TS刀，3红光月月 S，6红光月月 T S；如果只有TS刀，3红光月月 T，6红光月月 T S</span></span> 。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">鲸鱼：装备“夏日饕餮”魂卡，T S S S S ，否则 S 。<br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">其余天子：S 。</span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1.2火弓与火神</span></span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1601286108760_60336819.png\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13uA9CEOJwvAAAAAFeu4KE828.png\" alt=\"小不点迪娜希\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span>火弓与火神同为双刃剑。火神目前点火双刃剑数值下降，而且下次维护才修复（好歹修复了，伊芙，我的伊芙）。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">考虑到点火前后输出的天壤之别，而大多数玩家更愿意集中资源培养一个6红刀，得到普遍性结论：相同加值下，火弓＞火神。</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">事实上，对于没有高加火弓的人来说，这期就是折磨。不点火，火神没有优先最高攻；点火，双刃剑幅度下降，而且还要消耗点火素材。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">火弓不仅有技能条瞬补，而且6红两体双刃剑变三体。</span></span>从长远来看，火神不点火更好。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span>技能预约：S 。</span></span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.Leader天子</span></span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/9C/ChpCl13vUD2EXJY4AAAAABJfd10864.png\" alt=\"驱魔师尼尔提\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gBTCEfRv7AAAAAGdooMc218.jpg\" alt=\"浪漫的伊菲斯\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 94px;\"><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618210194_12271950.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618210194_12271950.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"></span></span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">还是那句话，除非你是氪佬，每个debuff天子都有附魔，不然还是推荐leader用减益回避率下降。</span></span>宋丹丹（需点火）、狗姐、火伊芙提供队长技能。宋丹丹U之后所有wb都减少debuff回避率，需要较多资源，为了JJC所以U了宋丹丹的各位可以上了，狗姐原本就是万金油队长，如果木人鱼低加请选狗姐同时让狗姐T。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">技能预约：6红宋丹丹 S ；狗姐 T ；火伊芙随意。</span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">3.其余可选天子</span></span></span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/82/ChpCl13nYY2EY18zAAAAAJ3K4fU025.png\" alt=\"流浪者的潘迪恩\"></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">低加金币娘是不如泡面的，除非上3把以上的刀。有的话还是上高加金币娘。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：S 。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13t-72ETMBRAAAAAEONAr8699.png\" alt=\"疾走的玛尔斯\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gCnGEUGNvAAAAALStrxk044.png\" alt=\"纯白的波摩纳\"><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618804262_743551.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618804262_743551.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"></span></span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">水炮全体上盾，请务必不要点火，点火后水炮SS会给队友上持续恢复，毒奶警告！</div><div class=\"div-img\">花奶2体清除减益并提供持续恢复，不用怕成为内鬼</div><div class=\"div-img\">火勒达在提供稳定攻击力buff的同时，可以提供3体护盾，高加值队伍中可以替换掉水炮。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：S 。</span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/15/58/ChpCl15EzVqEKkI_AAAAAFqFT2o144.png\" alt=\"伪君子巴贝尔\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 90px;\"><span><span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594191611278_91042388.png\" alt=\"脸红心跳希特莉\"></span></span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">狗哥（左）强力退条阻止boss放DS，退DS条同时减速。</div><div class=\"div-img\">木猫（右）魅惑，阻止boss的提升自身防御力buff。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">在这里我强烈建议有能力保护前排的玩家不要上狗哥！注意boss的DS，虽然会提升自身攻击力防御力，但是结束后会有一段衰弱期，这期间对boss的伤害会提高。事实上对于高加值队伍这俩都不是必需的。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">技能预约：S 。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">4.刀卡选择（点火和不点火分开讨论）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">4.1不点火（默认带情人节勒达，情人节勒达可以送掉）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. 火伞：SS四连。<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：S 。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2. 红妲比、魔王妲比：TS三连，<span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">请给1或者2攻</span></span>。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">技能预约：T 。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. 南瓜：SS四连。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">技能预约：S 。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. 火狗、草莓：SS三连。<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：S 。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">4.2点火（默认6红情人节勒达）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">只推荐给火伞、魔龙、情人节勒达点火。6红后都为SS六连。<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：魔龙 S ；火伞、情人节勒达 T S S S S （已测试）。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">如果是为Raid作准备，也可以点火红妲比但是不推荐。6红后TS四连，请给1或者2攻。<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：T 。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 182, 79); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">四、前后排站位</span></span></span><br></p></div></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1.水属性天子放后排（水炮可以考虑前排？）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2.火属性天子除了刀外优先放前排。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3.六星天子、点火（红防）天子优先放前排。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">五、攻击力调整</span></span><br></span></p></div></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span>根据使用火神还是火弓、火神与火弓的点火情况、派对梅芙的点火情况、队伍组成而定，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">非常复杂写不下</span>。</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span>有想要请教个人做法的可以评论区。</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 182, 79); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">六、魂卡推荐</span></span></span><br></p></div></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">攻击型天子：推荐新魂卡或者“沙滩陷阱的俘虏”，P闪卡分别为27%和22%的伤害提升。都没有可以用“万圣节歌姬”。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">鲸鱼：“夏日饕餮”记得改技能预约。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">前排：尽可能血防拉满（优先堆血量）。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">后排：<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">根据攻击力调整配置即可。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 182, 79); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">七、ds顺序</span></span></span></span><br></p></div></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DS顺序建议光月月——X（推荐木人鱼？）——金币（没有金币娘用糖猫）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(0, 182, 79); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">八、点火相关</span></span></span><br></p></div></span><br></span></div>优先点火伞、魔龙、情人节勒达、火弓（只有3把6红刀才点火弓）、派对梅芙。</span></div><div><span></span><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611829765292_6490290.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 22757, "username": "聚义灬efg", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/24.png", "description": "咸鱼一个", "follow_num": 7, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "退休老年人", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 126616236, "content_num": 12, "read_num": 226578, "like_num": 87}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 